{"id":"71806da6139ee022","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-cor-totality-variation.md","title":"Total Variation Norm","display":"cor-totality-variation — Total Variation Norm","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-totality-variation","aliases":["58-cor-totality-variation"],"display":"cor-totality-variation — Total Variation Norm","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-total-variation.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-totality-variation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-totality-variation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-totality-variation — Total Variation Norm"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bf89ebe6b026d89d\" href=\"?note=bf89ebe6b026d89d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-total-variation.md\">../batch01/58-df-total-variation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dd3d9d6492d2dd8b\" href=\"?note=dd3d9d6492d2dd8b\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md\">../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu,\\mu^+,\\mu^-,X,\\mathcal F,v,P,N\\in V\">\\(\\mu,\\mu^+,\\mu^-,X,\\mathcal F,v,P,N\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (signed-measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dd3d9d6492d2dd8b\" href=\"?note=dd3d9d6492d2dd8b\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md\">../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (nonnegative-measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalVariationMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalVariationMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (total-variation relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bf89ebe6b026d89d\" href=\"?note=bf89ebe6b026d89d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-total-variation.md\">../batch01/58-df-total-variation.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}totality\\text{-}variation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu^+,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu^-,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl(\\mu(E)=\\mu^+(E)-\\mu^-(E)\\bigr)\n\\land\\exists P,N\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl(P\\cup N=X\\land P\\cap N=\\emptyset\\land\\mu^-(P)=0\\land\\mu^+(N)=0\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{TotalVariationMeasure}_S(v,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land v(X)&lt;\\infty\n\\to\nv(X)=\\mu^+(X)+\\mu^-(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}totality\\text{-}variation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu^+,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu^-,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl(\\mu(E)=\\mu^+(E)-\\mu^-(E)\\bigr)\n\\land\\exists P,N\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl(P\\cup N=X\\land P\\cap N=\\emptyset\\land\\mu^-(P)=0\\land\\mu^+(N)=0\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{TotalVariationMeasure}_S(v,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land v(X)&lt;\\infty\n\\to\nv(X)=\\mu^+(X)+\\mu^-(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Jordan-decomposition conditions are expanded instead of invoking an undefined local predicate.</li>\n<li>The finiteness premise makes the displayed total variation finite; the upstream atom defines the measure <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> but does not define a separate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}\">\\(\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}\\)</span> operator.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-total-variation.md","status":"resolved","id":"bf89ebe6b026d89d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-total-variation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"dd3d9d6492d2dd8b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"dd3d9d6492d2dd8b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (signed-measure predicate, see [[../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (nonnegative-measure predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-total-variation.md","status":"resolved","id":"bf89ebe6b026d89d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TotalVariationMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (total-variation relation, see [[../batch01/58-df-total-variation.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mu,\\mu^+,\\mu^-,X,\\mathcal F,v,P,N\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalVariationMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}totality\\text{-}variation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu^+,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu^-,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl(\\mu(E)=\\mu^+(E)-\\mu^-(E)\\bigr)\n\\land\\exists P,N\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl(P\\cup N=X\\land P\\cap N=\\emptyset\\land\\mu^-(P)=0\\land\\mu^+(N)=0\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{TotalVariationMeasure}_S(v,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land v(X)<\\infty\n\\to\nv(X)=\\mu^+(X)+\\mu^-(X).","display":true},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}","display":false}],"bytes":1578,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-90","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-cor-totality-variation.md|58-cor-totality-variation]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["bf89ebe6b026d89d","dd3d9d6492d2dd8b","ca832ed6bc22f728"]}